# a11y-scout consolidated reports and Playwright trace/video artifacts.
#
# Kept inside this folder rather than at the repository root so that most of what the suite
# produces disappears with `rm -rf a11y/`. It is not all of it: a11y-scout writes its per-scan
# output to `./a11y-reports` at the root and offers no way to redirect it — `ScanPageOptions`
# has no `outDir`, only `generateReport()` does — so the root `.gitignore` carries that one
# entry and deleting this folder leaves it behind. See README.md.
reports/
artifacts/
node_modules/
